The legal text is the Constitution of the Republic of Djibouti, as published by the Presidency of the Republic:

  Source: https://www.presidence.dj/page/constitution
  Read on 29 October 2026.

The text of the Constitution is the law of Djibouti, published by the Presidency for public use. This repository
makes no claim over it.

Changes made by Lexifina: the web page was converted to one Markdown file per article, with HTML removed and
whitespace and apostrophes normalised. The wording is otherwise the Presidency's. Not an official copy.

The Code civil of the Republic of Djibouti (loi n° 003/AN/18/8ème L du 12 avril 2018) is copied from the text republished by WIPO Lex (https://wipolex-res.wipo.int/edocs/lexdocs/laws/fr/dj/dj026fr.pdf), read on 30 October 2026. The PDF states no licence.

The Code de commerce of the Republic of Djibouti (loi n° 134/AN/11/6ème L du 1er août 2012) is copied from the text republished by WIPO Lex (https://wipolex-res.wipo.int/edocs/lexdocs/laws/fr/dj/dj023fr.pdf), read on 30 October 2026. The PDF states no licence.

The Code pénal of Djibouti (loi n° 59/AN/94 du 5 janvier 1995 portant Code pénal) is copied from the PDF held by FAOLEX (https://faolex.fao.org/docs/pdf/dji244285.pdf), read on 30 October 2026. The PDF states no licence.

The Code du travail of the Republic of Djibouti (loi n° 133/AN/05/5ème L du 28 janvier 2006 portant Code du travail) is copied from the official text in the Journal officiel de la République de Djibouti (https://www.journalofficiel.dj/texte-juridique/loi-n133-an-05-5eme-l-portant-code-du-travail/), read on 30 October 2026. The page states no licence.

The Code de la famille of the Republic of Djibouti (loi n° 152/AN/02/4ème L du 31 janvier 2002 portant Code de la famille) is copied from the official French text in the Journal officiel de la République de Djibouti (https://www.journalofficiel.dj/texte-juridique/loi-n152-an-02-4eme-l-portant-code-de-la-famille/), read on 30 October 2026. The page states no licence.

The Code de protection juridique des mineurs of the Republic of Djibouti (loi n° 95/AN/15/7ème L du 18 mai 2015) is copied from the official text in the Journal officiel de la République de Djibouti (https://www.journalofficiel.dj/texte-juridique/loi-n95-an-15-7eme-l-portant-code-de-protection-juridique-des-mineurs/), read on 30 October 2026. The page states no licence.
